1. A computer-implemented method comprising:  
receiving, by a computing device and from a web page, a request for advertising code;  
identifying, from among a plurality of stored versions of the advertising code, a version having a most recent update indication;  
generating a response comprising the identified version of the advertising code; and  
transmitting, by the computing device, the response to the web page for execution or incorporation by the web page.
